00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:06,900
Answer the questions below.

2
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:13,900
What does the lion do when the mouse asks to spare?

3
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:19,420
Mark X before correct answer.

4
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:24,150
Does not spare the mouse.

5
00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:27,970
Lets the mouse go.

6
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:31,050
Invites the mouse to be friends.

7
00:00:34,070 --> 00:00:42,000
Answer: The lion lets the mouse go.

8
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:49,250
When spared by the lion, what does the mouse say?

9
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:55,350
Mark X before correct answer.

10
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:59,220
Thank you sir.

11
00:00:59,220 --> 00:01:03,770
Sir is very kind.

12
00:01:03,770 --> 00:01:06,870
Sir be friends with me.

13
00:01:10,450 --> 00:01:19,070
Answer: The mouse says thank you sir.

14
00:01:19,070 --> 00:01:27,150
What does the mouse do when the lion is caught in net?

15
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:34,100
Mark X before correct answer.

16
00:01:34,100 --> 00:01:38,400
Does nothing.

17
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:44,520
Chew through net, save lion.

18
00:01:44,520 --> 00:01:47,400
Call friends to help.

19
00:01:51,470 --> 00:02:00,570
Answer: The mouse chews through net, saves lion.

